# checks/denylist.local — operator-specific strings the public repo must never contain.
# This example file IS published; keep it placeholder-only. Copy to denylist.local
# (git-ignored) and put your REAL values there. One extended-regex per line, # = comment.
#
# Types to cover:
# your-own-name               # personal names, real first/last names
# your-handle                 # social/github handles tied to you
# your-host-hostname          # real machine hostnames and their short forms
# your-agent-ids              # the agent_id strings your deployment uses
# peer-a-name                 # your peers' agent names, in roster order
# peer-of-yours-secret-script # private helper script filenames
# internal-doctrine-name      # names of internal-only docs/rules
